The builder and the answerer are different agents. PROTOCOL.md §7 names the reviewer as the answerer; this relay assigned the answers to the implementer. The identities are recorded so MAP-GATE-2 can audit the separation-of-roles condition and the C1 condition. This file does not decide either one.

