No `src/` file was opened to answer. `sonde query` was not run. No answer was checked against the indexed graph.

The answerer is an agent. The complete and simple maps keep their graph in one JSON payload that the page draws. There was no browser session and no click-timing. Each map answer is the list that page's panel shows from that JSON: files, symbols, "Depends on", and "Depended on by", with unverified edges hidden unless the cell says otherwise. Elapsed figures below are the duration of a second, scripted pass over data already read. They are not a cold human reading time. No cold time is invented here.

